      "artist": "Siarhei Besarab",
      "description": "A liquid-fuel rocket engine for the A-4 (V-2) ballistic missile, displayed at the Peenemünde Historical Technical Museum. While the A-4 rocket was developed in Peenemünde, this specific engine was produced in the spring of 1945 at the Mittelwerk underground factory, using slave labor from the Mittelbau-Dora concentration camp. The exhibit is on loan from the Mittelbau-Dora Memorial.",
